# Do Not Start Dev Server for Verification

Do NOT start the dev server (`bun run dev`) just to verify that code compiles or changes work.

The user runs their own dev server. Only start the dev server if explicitly requested.

Acceptable reasons to start dev server:
- User explicitly asks to start it
- User asks to test something that requires a running server

NOT acceptable:
- "Let me verify the changes compile"
- "Let me start the dev server to check"
- Starting it after making code changes
